        <p class="eyebrow">Life, as loved</p>
        <h1>The life you're <em>actually in.</em></h1>
        <p class="lede">Not the one you planned. This one. Being mindful is the work: noticing what is here, and loving it enough to change it.</p>
        <div class="ctarow"><a class="btn btn-acc" href="#" data-open-form>Begin with Vault</a><a class="btn btn-line" href="#who">Who this is for</a></div>
