      </div></div>
    </section>
    <section class="sec gallery-sec faces"><div class="wrap"><p class="strip-head">The present · what we look at</p><div class="gallery"><figure><img src="/img/russ/strip/snorkel.jpg" alt="Russ snorkeling over a deep rock fissure" style="object-position:50% 30%" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>Your body</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506126613408-eca07ce68773?w=1000&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="A person meditating at sunrise on a wooden deck" style="object-position:50% 0%" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>Your attention</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1511988617509-a57c8a288659?w=1000&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Friends laughing together outdoors" style="object-position:50% 40%" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>Your people</figcaption></figure></div></div></section>

    <section class="sec" id="what"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">What we look at</p><h2>The things happening right now.</h2><p class="lede">Your body, your attention, your relationships, your work this week.</p></div>
      <div class="pains"><div class="pain"><h3>Your body</h3><p>Sleep, the walk, the table. The Body Vault starts on your feet, every other day.</p></div><div class="pain"><h3>Your attention</h3><p>Where it goes, who gets it, what it costs you. Noticing is the first skill.</p></div><div class="pain"><h3>Your people</h3><p>The conversation you keep not having. We rehearse it, then you have it.</p></div></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec alt" id="who"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">Who this is for</p><h2>Three kinds of people start here.</h2></div>
      <div class="steps"><div class="step"><div class="n">01</div><h3>Individuals</h3><p>You want a coach who knows your story and walks the year beside you.</p></div><div class="step"><div class="n">02</div><h3>Executives and leaders</h3><p>You carry real decisions and nobody around you can be fully honest with you.</p></div><div class="step"><div class="n">03</div><h3>Families and couples</h3><p>You want one rhythm in the house instead of four schedules and no shared language.</p></div></div>
      <p class="offers-note">Every path starts the same way: your first key tomorrow morning, a 30-minute conversation with Russ in your first week, then $99 a month. The first week is on us. <a href="/plans/">See all plans</a>. <a href="/plans/">See pricing.</a></p>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec gallery-sec"><div class="wrap"><p class="strip-head">The present · love, practiced daily</p><div class="gallery"><figure><img src="/img/russ/v2/loved-pose.jpg" alt="Russ holding a yoga pose on the beach at sunset" style="object-position:50% 88%" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>Move</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="/img/russ/v2/loved-table.jpg" alt="A home-cooked spread of salads, corn and fajitas" style="object-position:50% 50%" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>Nourish</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="/img/russ/v2/loved-heart.jpg" alt="Light pouring into a heart-shaped slot canyon" style="object-position:50% 50%" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>Recover</figcaption></figure></div></div></section>

    <section class="sec" id="russ-as-loved"><div class="wrap"><div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">Russ, as loved</p><h2>What I love.</h2></div><div class="lgrid"><figure class="big"><video style="--p:50% 45%;--pm:50% 45%" class="fg" autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="metadata" poster="/img/russ/v2/loved-ropes-poster.jpg" aria-label="Russ training with battle ropes in his garage gym"><source src="/img/russ/v2/loved-ropes.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video></figure><figure><video style="--p:50% 62%;--pm:50% 62%" class="fg" autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="metadata" poster="/img/russ/v2/lived-running-poster.jpg" aria-label="Russ sprinting down a red running track"><source src="/img/russ/v2/lived-running.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video></figure><figure><img style="--p:50% 15%" class="fg" src="/img/russ/v2/loved-surf.jpg" alt="Russ surfing a wave" width="889" height="1400" loading="lazy" /></figure><figure><img style="--p:50% 30%" class="fg" src="/img/russ/v2/lived-como-boat.jpg" alt="Russ driving a boat on Lake Como" width="1400" height="788" loading="lazy" /></figure><figure><img style="--p:50% 30%" class="fg" src="/img/russ/v2/russ-beach.jpg" alt="Russ barefoot on the beach facing the sunset" width="898" height="1400" loading="lazy" /></figure><figure><img style="--p:50% 30%" class="fg" src="/img/russ/v2/russ-polevault.jpg" alt="Russ clearing the bar as a young pole vaulter" width="862" height="525" loading="lazy" /></figure></div>
    </div></section>
<style is:global>
  .lgrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));grid-auto-rows:230px;gap:14px}
  .lgrid figure{margin:0;position:relative;overflow:hidden;border-radius:10px;background:#0d0f0d}
  .lgrid .big{grid-column:span 2;grid-row:span 2}
  .lgrid.tall .big{grid-column:span 1}
    .lgrid .fg{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:var(--p,50% 50%)}
  @media(max-width:760px){.lgrid .fg{object-position:var(--pm,var(--p,50% 50%))}.lgrid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));grid-auto-rows:170px;gap:10px}.lgrid .big,.lgrid.tall .big{grid-column:span 2;grid-row:span 2}.lgrid:not(.tall) .big{grid-row:span 1}.lgrid:not(.tall) figure:last-child{grid-column:span 2}}
  .lgrid.loved{grid-auto-rows:270px}
  .lgrid.loved .big{grid-column:span 1}
  @media(max-width:760px){.lgrid.loved .big.portrait{grid-column:span 2;grid-row:span 3}.lgrid.loved figure:last-child{grid-column:span 2}}
</style>
